DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19817::$$$message_0157_0000_0000$$$::"Gwaaah!?"[lr]::
19818::$$$message_0157_0000_0001$$$::I go flying like tree leaves in a breeze.::
19819::$$$message_0157_0001_0000$$$::"Kuh... Y-you rookie![lr]::
19820::$$$message_0157_0001_0001$$$::Urgh. Did...did you think such lies would work on me!?[lr]::
19821::$$$message_0157_0001_0002$$$::D-don't look down on me. Ugh. Flattery doesn't sway me that easily![lr]::
19822::$$$message_0157_0001_0003$$$::...It really doesn't, but, oh my god, what's with these questions!?"::
19823::$$$message_0157_0002_0000$$$::The Quiz Fiend howls "waaaah," like a wild animal.[lr]::
19824::$$$message_0157_0002_0001$$$::Her roar is nothing less than lamentation.::
19825::$$$message_0157_0003_0000$$$::"Unfortunately, I still can't give you a treasure card.[lr]::
19826::$$$message_0157_0003_0001$$$::I was hoping to give you a whole bunch, but I need to keep personal and business matters separate."::
19827::$$$message_0157_0004_0000$$$::The Quiz Fiend weeps quietly.[lr]::
19828::$$$message_0157_0004_0001$$$::That's the tragedy of being middle management.::
19829::$$$message_0157_0005_0000$$$::"...Anyhow, I win this time, and I'm not happy about it at all.[lr]::
19830::$$$message_0157_0005_0001$$$::Come see me again if you want treasure. It'll be a tough fight for me either way, but I'll be waiting for you. Haah..."::
19831::$$$message_0157_0006_0000$$$::The Quiz Fiend plods away.[lr]::
19832::$$$message_0157_0006_0001$$$::"I feel like I did something bad to her..."[lr]::
19833::$$$message_0157_0006_0002$$$::This must be what people mean when they say you shouldn't feel pity for someone unless you really mean it.[lr]::
19834::$$$message_0157_0006_0003$$$::The next time I come, I'm going to need to blaze through all of her questions.::
99825::$$$message_9157_0003_0000$$$::"Unfortunately, I still can't give you a treasure card."[r]ùNñ